{"hash": "2bcb8191653a18e1c6dd71d21e39f51626e51c070e1fed73f8a7dd3073738831", "id": "T-t1-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "genesis", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 7, "line_start": 7, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. A human must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "ec69559b0a752582dbe7898c3f0b24f10ace09d88f3a4f5e7c7278e91426f9a6", "id": "T-t1-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "2bcb8191653a18e1c6dd71d21e39f51626e51c070e1fed73f8a7dd3073738831", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. An agent must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b70e45789447cba12ed495869c5d66d006277d48f3625a72d72bd77178b5bcee", "id": "T-t1-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "ec69559b0a752582dbe7898c3f0b24f10ace09d88f3a4f5e7c7278e91426f9a6", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 9, "line_start": 9, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. An internal or external event must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "58abff52ec7f33d22cd7b6f8079ebd71b50bdbd2f96534f3de39bb9a5cd36bef", "id": "T-t2-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b70e45789447cba12ed495869c5d66d006277d48f3625a72d72bd77178b5bcee", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 13, "line_start": 13, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Composability hides the complexity.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "5475e618d3a2da88d09cd762d3b3c9a3a31330e85f10def60f2e45d975bbc642", "id": "T-t2-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "58abff52ec7f33d22cd7b6f8079ebd71b50bdbd2f96534f3de39bb9a5cd36bef", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 14, "line_start": 14, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Composability allows enhancing particular aspects of any element without touching the rest.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "8cea7a4abdb9f3d2805ee562794fe2e8f8f3f6ffae9e9ecc4ffa6c050f122b32", "id": "T-t2-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "5475e618d3a2da88d09cd762d3b3c9a3a31330e85f10def60f2e45d975bbc642", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 15, "line_start": 15, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. State, telemetry, and every cross-cutting concern are managed across the entire structure, whichever entry point was used.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "655969dd023eff146ac7304d94010280761ae9751a69f96435290f047933fbc2", "id": "T-t3-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "8cea7a4abdb9f3d2805ee562794fe2e8f8f3f6ffae9e9ecc4ffa6c050f122b32", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 19, "line_start": 19, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. It has to be simple to use.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6408419447a78bbfa2735d91d06e455efa123ff3f64a601f00e06de63bb14207", "id": "T-t3-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "655969dd023eff146ac7304d94010280761ae9751a69f96435290f047933fbc2", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 20, "line_start": 20, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. It cannot be daunting or overly complex, or no one will use it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d6285ae90f53a88a0a2fc5618f6271d2a48ac2dec4bd67d7429b67b2671b7392", "id": "T-t4-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6408419447a78bbfa2735d91d06e455efa123ff3f64a601f00e06de63bb14207", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 24, "line_start": 24, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Treat this as a baseline target and improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b93e217e89d11f94ddc5ec51b3cf9ade05ea0c25b49925f8d0c3c548cb79b528", "id": "T-t4-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d6285ae90f53a88a0a2fc5618f6271d2a48ac2dec4bd67d7429b67b2671b7392", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 25, "line_start": 25, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Decompose it; add the skills, loops, and agents needed to reach it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "17b29c4ea691789a98cfdac7daa759eb6a639f7b60e02633e44d2d5786c04e20", "id": "T-t4-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b93e217e89d11f94ddc5ec51b3cf9ade05ea0c25b49925f8d0c3c548cb79b528", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 26, "line_start": 26, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. PASS.md's list is a limited baseline: understand what an end-to-end version is, make up for the gaps, and solve it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b9ab9c69021b40a987c5b5d79f65bcce2665898f217fb744c051bd347ce0a19d", "id": "T-t4-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "17b29c4ea691789a98cfdac7daa759eb6a639f7b60e02633e44d2d5786c04e20", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 27, "line_start": 27, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Work through every item with a self-improvement loop: at the end of each section a ceremony re-reviews the output, improves the skills that produced it, and the loop continues.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "afc8325b57503d9f052ba0d0683bb52b69794c1364dc2d7019030335263338a5", "id": "T-t5-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b9ab9c69021b40a987c5b5d79f65bcce2665898f217fb744c051bd347ce0a19d", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 31, "line_start": 31, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Do not stop at ceremonies; run them and continue.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "a5f0c4a5bf9476cb47cad24f79cf806e4dcfce1be86ec2c4f4f7483b35452ef6", "id": "T-t5-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "afc8325b57503d9f052ba0d0683bb52b69794c1364dc2d7019030335263338a5", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 32, "line_start": 32, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. When a problem comes up, use 1-3-1: define the problem, identify the three best possible solutions that align to the goal, and follow the recommendation.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "3f6cf730beda9573e50998d53d484d0f9bb35def321ca9a19f39d5a730c7d95e", "id": "T-t5-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "a5f0c4a5bf9476cb47cad24f79cf806e4dcfce1be86ec2c4f4f7483b35452ef6", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 33, "line_start": 33, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. If no recommendation is found, drop the two lowest solutions, find two more, and repeat until solved.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "de8b847eb03affe04f87ca08a243b66fa5485052fc76d03bd53eedadd866a4e3", "id": "T-t6-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "3f6cf730beda9573e50998d53d484d0f9bb35def321ca9a19f39d5a730c7d95e", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 37, "line_start": 37, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. There is one way to consume the platform, shown as code end to end: what is called, with what, and what comes back.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "49a5ed92302661bc59307a8dfd5323496be01965e4af046d9ddda2abdb5e73b3", "id": "T-t6-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "de8b847eb03affe04f87ca08a243b66fa5485052fc76d03bd53eedadd866a4e3", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 38, "line_start": 38, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Four entries cover nearly every situation: a human, an event, a schedule (time), and an external system or agent. All four enter through the same shape.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6cb1b009a74919e9d49b135fdd78f44791105e89e6fafade7d57a80d02f0a749", "id": "T-t6-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "49a5ed92302661bc59307a8dfd5323496be01965e4af046d9ddda2abdb5e73b3", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 39, "line_start": 39, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Any entry can call complex workflows, agents, and loops that run across the entire stack.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "4927522167c2d0fd15331e98dca39577ea619153e66fe6f6180731380d122474", "id": "T-t6-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6cb1b009a74919e9d49b135fdd78f44791105e89e6fafade7d57a80d02f0a749", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 40, "line_start": 40, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Multiple models are used through one gateway, and a fleet of GPUs serves local models; callers request a model class, not a vendor.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "171179c15b001e4443bc27b7a5d437bb0ec8760f6cff43fad555807cdf4c12ea", "id": "T-t6-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "4927522167c2d0fd15331e98dca39577ea619153e66fe6f6180731380d122474", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 41, "line_start": 41, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Each agent is defined up front by what it is good at, so callers know how to call it and how to sequence it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "dd69dd661551548c2940847506231035cccecb0850e4da593502a7ca3438d7d4", "id": "T-t6-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "171179c15b001e4443bc27b7a5d437bb0ec8760f6cff43fad555807cdf4c12ea", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 42, "line_start": 42, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. The target scale is well over a hundred agents running at a time, working together, managing state, breaking problems down, and self-improving where they can.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "9d0341165c33d1e236bc078dbc19b59ff1cbadfe2170029468fc3343866604c1", "id": "T-t7-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "dd69dd661551548c2940847506231035cccecb0850e4da593502a7ca3438d7d4", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 46, "line_start": 46, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The harness is an overlay that integrates across every component fluidly; it never pins the integration to a component.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "57252f305ab0b42cfe75756892a9d7efbc826c555247c94096cd28b60af77ab9", "id": "T-t7-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "9d0341165c33d1e236bc078dbc19b59ff1cbadfe2170029468fc3343866604c1", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 47, "line_start": 47, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Every harness call goes through the capability interface, and the component sits behind an adapter.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "0e3f671e4574109f2805698e6143b2d00f7c92745598fac8804753f0f080319d", "id": "T-t7-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "57252f305ab0b42cfe75756892a9d7efbc826c555247c94096cd28b60af77ab9", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 48, "line_start": 48, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Each component has a minimal call in isolation, and the same calls are linked across the composable elements.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "77ef8c857e2a90cb6a2b408a39f2ee8b358dea7bc8d5e1b0a4524116f18f6758", "id": "T-t7-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "0e3f671e4574109f2805698e6143b2d00f7c92745598fac8804753f0f080319d", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 49, "line_start": 49, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Standards will change, systems will change, and components will change; the harness shows where the impacts are.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "176c82c30c3b5f2c7bc4252623efbed55b1f1afcfc52974b236e73f84b57070d", "id": "T-t7-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "77ef8c857e2a90cb6a2b408a39f2ee8b358dea7bc8d5e1b0a4524116f18f6758", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 50, "line_start": 50, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Changing a component means swapping its adapter, and the conformance run proves the interface held.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "22bd175a62ff25dd8b6f509d81aa1f73bcbb32b3d9b200254c1a58da215516cd", "id": "T-t7-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "176c82c30c3b5f2c7bc4252623efbed55b1f1afcfc52974b236e73f84b57070d", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 51, "line_start": 51, "sha256": "0d8353043b3bfbbdbb8b60dc7c4fe7cf40798eff3d7b8d1b81508062f75a2e13"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. This direction is a target toward perfection, not a fixed definition; improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
